{
  "label": "Action Request",
  "category": "Alert Acquirer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Action Request Management",
      "id": "action-request",
      "intro": "Action Request memungkinkan analyst untuk escalate alert atau request action dari supervisor/team lead. Support workflow approval dan tracking status.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Apa itu Action Request?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Mekanisme formal untuk escalate alert ke level lebih tinggi\n• Request approval untuk action tertentu (block, refund, etc)\n• Track status: Pending → Approved → Completed / Rejected\n• Include reason, evidence, dan recommended action\n• Audit trail lengkap untuk compliance",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.05),0 10px 30px rgba(59,130,246,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6 0%,#2563eb 50%,#1d4ed8 100%);padding:18px 20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:18px 18px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><path d=\"M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">Action Request</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:2px;\">Escalation & Approval Workflow</div></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">⏳ PENDING</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">✓ APPROVED</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">✓✓ COMPLETED</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">✕ REJECTED</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Membuat Action Request",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Buka alert detail yang ingin di-escalate\n• Klik tab **Action Request** atau tombol **Create Action Request**\n• Isi form:\n  - **Request Type**: Block Account, Refund, Report, Other\n  - **Priority**: High / Medium / Low\n  - **Reason**: Penjelasan mengapa perlu action\n  - **Evidence**: Link atau attachment pendukung\n  - **Recommended Action**: Saran action yang harus diambil\n• Klik **Submit** untuk kirim request",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fffbeb;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">New Action Request</span><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#f59e0b;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">Submit</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Request Type</div><select style=\"width:100%;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;\"><option>Block Account</option><option>Refund</option><option>Report</option></select></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Priority</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">HIGH</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">MEDIUM</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">LOW</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Reason</div><textarea style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;resize:none;\" rows=\"2\">Suspicious transaction pattern detected...</textarea></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Lihat Status Action Request",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Akses menu **Action Request** dari alert detail\n• Lihat list semua action request terkait alert\n• Status badge menunjukkan state saat ini:\n  - 🟡 **PENDING** — Menunggu review\n  - 🟢 **APPROVED** — Approved, siap dieksekusi\n  - 🔵 **COMPLETED** — Sudah dieksekusi\n  - 🔴 **REJECTED** — Ditolak dengan alasan\n• Klik request untuk lihat detail & history",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Action Requests</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">REQ-001 • Block Account</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fcd34d;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">⏳ PENDING</span></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Requested by John Analyst • 2 hrs ago</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">REQ-002 • Refund</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">✓ APPROVED</span></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Approved by Supervisor • 1 day ago</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Review & Approve Request (Supervisor)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Supervisor akses list pending action requests\n• Review detail request:\n  - Alert info & classification\n  - Reason & evidence dari analyst\n  - Recommended action\n  - Risk assessment\n• Action yang bisa diambil:\n  - **Approve** — Setujui request\n  - **Reject** — Tolak dengan alasan\n  - **Request More Info** — Minta klarifikasi\n• Add comment untuk feedback",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f3ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#7c3aed);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Review Action Request</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f5f3ff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:2px;\">Request Type</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Block Account</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:4px;\">Reason</div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:10px;\">Multiple suspicious transactions from same IP. Customer denies all transactions.</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#16a34a;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">✓ Approve</button><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#dc2626;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">✕ Reject</button><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;cursor:pointer;\">More Info</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Execute Approved Action",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Setelah approved, analyst execute action yang disetujui\n• Klik **Execute** pada approved request\n• Isi form execution:\n  - **Execution Notes**: Detail action yang diambil\n  - **Result**: Success / Failed\n  - **Evidence**: Screenshot atau bukti eksekusi\n• Update status menjadi **COMPLETED**\n• Notification dikirim ke requester & approver\n• Alert status updated sesuai action",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdfa;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#14b8a6,#0d9488);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Execute Action</span></div><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">✓ APPROVED</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Execution Notes</div><textarea style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;resize:none;\" rows=\"2\">Account blocked successfully. Customer notified via email...</textarea></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#14b8a6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">✓✓ Mark as Completed</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
